From e9ebd9e130f607e35d872e33caec694efefa41c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 20:37:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: grow M4 tiler backing from a shared VM arena

Allocate scratch and tiler backing from opposite ends of the private aperture instead of reserving a fixed tiler-growth range. Grow toward a larger bounded TVB budget, retry smaller allocations under pressure, and publish the per-pool submission count through firmware-shared memory.

Validation: four allocator tests pass; the combined GPU object builds with ARCH=arm64 LLVM=1.

Assisted-By: OpenAI Codex (GPT-6 Astra)
Signed-off-by: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
